        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>人民日报 2025年2月15日</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #d8d8d8;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Noto Serif SC\", \"Songti SC\", SimSun, serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 800px;\n    min-height: 1135px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 7px 8px 0;\n    background: #fff;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .top {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 396px 224px 153px;\n    gap: 8px;\n    height: 178px;\n  }\n  .masthead {\n    position: relative;\n    height: 178px;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #111;\n  }\n  .logo {\n    height: 132px;\n    color: #c6001d;\n    font-family: KaiTi, STKaiti, \"Noto Serif SC\", serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 70px;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    transform: skew(-7deg);\n    transform-origin: left top;\n  }\n  .roman {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 121px;\n    left: 72px;\n    color: #a20a19;\n    font-family: Georgia, serif;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n  }\n  .site {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 10px;\n    left: 61px;\n    font-size: 7px;\n    letter-spacing: .4px;\n  }\n  .top-center {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 90px 1fr;\n    gap: 8px;\n    height: 178px;\n  }\n  .datebox {\n    height: 169px;\n    border: 2px solid #999;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding-top: 8px;\n    font-family: Arial, \"Noto Serif SC\", serif;\n  }\n  .datebox .year {\n    font-size: 8px;\n  }\n  .datebox .day {\n    margin: 7px 0 3px;\n    font-size: 21px;\n  }\n  .datebox .weekday,\n  .datebox .lunar,\n  .datebox .issue {\n    font-size: 7px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .datebox .rule {\n    width: 48px;\n    border-top: 1px solid #999;\n    margin: 5px auto;\n  }\n  .micro {\n    font-size: 6.5px;\n    line-height: 1.44;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .top-right {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 49px 22px 1fr;\n    gap: 2px;\n    height: 178px;\n  }\n  .vertical-title {\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    font-size: 27px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.05;\n    letter-spacing: 7px;\n    padding-top: 24px;\n  }\n  .vertical-subtitle {\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    border-left: 1px solid #555;\n    margin-top: 60px;\n    height: 112px;\n    padding: 2px 3px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .main {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 390px 382px;\n    gap: 9px;\n  }\n  .left-column {\n    border-right: 1px solid #777;\n    padding-right: 7px;\n  }\n  .right-column {\n    padding-left: 1px;\n  }\n  .headline {\n    margin: 11px 0 9px;\n    font-family: \"Noto Serif SC\", SimSun, serif;\n    font-size: 27px;\n    line-height: 1.14;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: -1px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .red-banner {\n    width: 256px;\n    margin: 7px 0 8px;\n    padding: 4px 7px;\n    color: #fff;\n    background: #c8102e;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .article-columns {\n    column-count: 3;\n    column-gap: 8px;\n    font-size: 7.2px;\n    line-height: 1.53;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .article-columns p,\n  .two-columns p,\n  .three-columns p {\n    margin: 0 0 4px;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n  .section-rule {\n    border-top: 1px solid #777;\n    margin: 9px 0 0;\n    padding-top: 8px;\n  }\n  .spaced-title {\n    margin: 0 0 9px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 25px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: 9px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .three-columns {\n    column-count: 3;\n    column-gap: 9px;\n    font-size: 7.1px;\n    line-height: 1.52;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .center-note {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 6px;\n    margin: 2px 0 5px;\n  }\n  .demand-banner {\n    width: 240px;\n    margin: 7px 0 8px auto;\n    padding: 4px 8px;\n    color: #fff;\n    background: #c8102e;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-align: center;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .farm-layout {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr;\n    gap: 6px;\n    margin-top: 5px;\n  }\n  .farm-caption {\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    font-size: 6.5px;\n    line-height: 1.65;\n    padding: 8px 2px 0;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    color: #333;\n    background: #ddd;\n    border: 1px solid #aaa;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 8px;\n  }\n  .farm-photo {\n    height: 196px;\n    position: relative;\n    background:\n      linear-gradient(to bottom, #b9dce4 0 18%, #d3e573 18% 44%, #83a43b 44% 49%, #8a6428 49% 100%);\n  }\n  .farm-photo::before,\n  .farm-photo::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 28px;\n    width: 48px;\n    height: 24px;\n    border-radius: 10px 14px 4px 4px;\n    background: #bd291f;\n    border: 2px solid #eee;\n    box-shadow: -10px 14px 0 -5px #222, 14px 14px 0 -5px #222;\n  }\n  .farm-photo::before { left: 45px; }\n  .farm-photo::after { right: 48px; bottom: 50px; transform: scale(.8); }\n  .bottom-links {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 6px;\n    margin-top: 7px;\n  }\n  .linkbox {\n    height: 54px;\n    border: 6px solid #f2f2f2;\n    padding: 7px 4px 2px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  .linkbox small {\n    display: block;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n    font-size: 6px;\n  }\n  .linkbox .byline {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 6px;\n    margin-top: 3px;\n  }\n  .opening-title {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #555;\n    padding: 4px 0 6px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .opening-title h1 {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    line-height: 1.23;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .opening-title h2 {\n    margin: 5px 0 0;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  .ceremony {\n    margin-top: 7px;\n    height: 182px;\n    position: relative;\n    background:\n      linear-gradient(150deg, #74a9cb 0 17%, transparent 17%),\n      linear-gradient(15deg, #294f79 0 31%, #d8e4f1 31% 67%, #7596bf 67% 100%);\n  }\n  .ceremony::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    height: 67px;\n    background: #d9dce2;\n    border-top: 5px solid #bd0b24;\n  }\n  .ceremony::after {\n    content: \"第九届亚洲冬季运动会\";\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 16px;\n    right: 20px;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .people {\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: 2;\n    bottom: 45px;\n    left: 72px;\n    width: 150px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n  }\n  .person {\n    width: 17px;\n    height: 48px;\n    border-radius: 9px 9px 2px 2px;\n    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #e3bd9e 0 17%, #232d46 17% 100%);\n  }\n  .photo-caption {\n    margin: 5px 15px 7px;\n    font-size: 6px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .right-story {\n    border-top: 1px solid #777;\n    padding-top: 6px;\n  }\n  .right-story .kicker {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    margin: 0 0 2px;\n  }\n  .right-story h2 {\n    margin: 0 0 8px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 25px;\n    line-height: 1.16;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n  }\n  .story-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 10px;\n    font-size: 7px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .story-grid p {\n    margin: 0 0 4px;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n  .county-banner {\n    width: 205px;\n    margin: 7px 0 6px auto;\n    padding: 4px 8px;\n    background: #c8102e;\n    color: white;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .bottom-right {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;\n    gap: 8px;\n    border-top: 1px solid #777;\n    margin-top: 7px;\n    padding-top: 7px;\n  }\n  .bottom-right h3 {\n    margin: 0 0 7px;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n  }\n  .bottom-right .text {\n    column-count: 2;\n    column-gap: 8px;\n    font-size: 6.8px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .bottom-right .text p,\n  .side-copy p {\n    margin: 0 0 4px;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n  .side-copy {\n    padding-top: 2px;\n    font-size: 6.5px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"page\">\n  <header class=\"top\">\n    <section class=\"masthead\">\n      <div class=\"logo\">人民日报</div>\n      <div class=\"roman\">RENMIN RIBAO</div>\n      <div class=\"site\">人民网网址：http://www.people.com.cn</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"top-center\">\n      <div class=\"datebox\">\n        <div class=\"year\">2025年2月</div>\n        <div class=\"day\">15</div>\n        <div class=\"weekday\">星期六</div>\n        <div class=\"lunar\">乙巳年正月十八</div>\n        <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n        <div class=\"issue\">人民日报社出版<br>国内统一连续出版物号<br>CN 11-0065<br>代号1-1<br>第2779期<br>今日8版</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"micro\">\n        <p>开放是中国式现代化的鲜明标识。</p>\n        <p>习近平总书记指出：“开放是人类文明进步的重要动力，是世界繁荣发展的必由之路。”</p>\n        <p>新时代新征程，中国坚定不移扩大高水平对外开放，以开放促改革、促发展。</p>\n        <p>中国的发展离不开世界，世界的繁荣也需要中国。高水平开放为各国共同发展带来更多机遇。</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"top-right\">\n      <div class=\"vertical-title\">扩大高水平对外开放</div>\n      <div class=\"vertical-subtitle\">二〇二五年·中国经济这么干④</div>\n      <div class=\"micro\">\n        <p>开放是中国式现代化的鲜明标识。</p>\n        <p>习近平总书记强调，要稳步扩大制度型开放，维护多边贸易体制，拓展国际循环。</p>\n        <p>扩大高水平对外开放，既是促进改革发展的重要动力，也是顺应经济全球化潮流的必然要求。</p>\n        <p>深化外贸体制改革，促进外贸稳量提质</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"main\">\n    <section class=\"left-column\">\n      <h1 class=\"headline\">重庆加快智能网联新能源汽车产业发展</h1>\n      <div class=\"red-banner\">坚定信心、打开改革发展新天地</div>\n\n      <article class=\"article-columns\">\n        <p>重庆两江新区，长安汽车工程师围绕智能网联新能源汽车开展技术攻关；生产线上，智能化设备高效运转。</p>\n        <p>近年来，重庆加快构建智能网联新能源汽车产业集群，推动产业链、创新链、人才链深度融合。</p>\n        <p>2024年4月，习近平总书记在重庆考察时指出：“重庆制造业有自身的结构特点和相应的优势，希望重庆牢牢抓住科技创新这个‘牛鼻子’，扬优势、补短板，抓当前、谋未来。”</p>\n        <p>重庆落实习近平总书记重要讲话精神，着眼传统制造业转型升级和新兴产业培育，推动汽车产业向新能源化、智能化、网联化方向发展。</p>\n        <p>紧扣产业发展需求，重庆强化科技创新和产业创新深度融合，提升关键核心技术攻关能力。</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>一批重点项目加快建设，产业生态持续完善，智能网联新能源汽车产业呈现良好发展态势。</p>\n        <p>瞄准产业链薄弱环节，重庆加强上下游协同，推动零部件企业与整车企业配套发展。</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>重庆市有关负责人表示，将进一步推动科技创新和产业创新融合发展，加快建设具有全国影响力的产业创新中心。</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <div class=\"section-rule\">\n        <h2 class=\"spaced-title\">如何大力提振消费</h2>\n        <div class=\"center-note\">本报记者　[illegible]　[illegible]</div>\n        <article class=\"three-columns\">\n          <p>服务消费增长较快，全国居民人均服务性消费支出同比增长；文体娱乐、交通出行等消费需求持续释放。</p>\n          <p>提振消费是扩大内需的重要着力点。要顺应消费升级趋势，创新消费场景，改善消费环境。</p>\n          <p>推动商品消费提质扩容，释放汽车、家电、家居等大宗消费潜力，促进绿色消费、数字消费、健康消费。</p>\n          <p>扩大服务消费，培育文娱旅游、体育赛事、养老托育等新的消费增长点。</p>\n          <p>“两新”政策持续显效，以旧换新带动相关产品销售增长，也为产业转型升级注入动力。</p>\n          <p>消费一头连着宏观经济，一头连着千家万户。提升消费能力、意愿和层级，需要多方面协同发力。</p>\n          <p>[illegible]</p>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"demand-banner\">政策问答·全方位扩大国内需求</div>\n\n      <div class=\"farm-layout\">\n        <div class=\"farm-caption\">\n          时下正是春耕备耕关键时期，各地加快推进农业生产。图为2月14日，湖南省永州市道县，农机在田间作业。\n        </div>\n        <figure class=\"placeholder farm-photo\" aria-label=\"春耕田野与农机照片\">\n          <span>[照片：田野中的农机]</span>\n        </figure>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bottom-links\">\n        <div class=\"linkbox\">\n          <small>科技·创新</small>\n          进化吧！未来的汽车\n          <span class=\"byline\">◆ 本报记者</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"linkbox\">\n          <small>科普</small>\n          冰雪与艺术的浪漫邂逅\n          <span class=\"byline\">◆ 本报记者</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"right-column\">\n      <header class=\"opening-title\">\n        <h1>第九届亚洲冬季运动会在哈尔滨圆满闭幕</h1>\n        <h2>李强出席闭幕式</h2>\n      </header>\n\n      <figure class=\"placeholder ceremony\" aria-label=\"第九届亚洲冬季运动会闭幕式照片\">\n        <div class=\"people\">\n          <span class=\"person\"></span>\n          <span class=\"person\"></span>\n          <span class=\"person\"></span>\n        </div>\n      </figure>\n      <div class=\"photo-caption\">\n        2月14日晚，第九届亚洲冬季运动会在哈尔滨圆满闭幕。国务院总理李强出席闭幕式。新华社记者　丁海涛摄\n      </div>\n\n      <article class=\"micro\">\n        <p>新华社哈尔滨2月14日电　欢快的旋律、热烈的掌声，第九届亚洲冬季运动会14日晚在哈尔滨圆满闭幕。国务院总理李强出席闭幕式。</p>\n        <p>在过去8天里，来自亚洲34个国家和地区的1200多名运动员在冰雪赛场奋勇拼搏、超越自我，展现亚洲冰雪运动蓬勃发展的新气象。</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"right-story\">\n        <div class=\"kicker\">山东广饶县改造提升传统产业——</div>\n        <h2>橡胶轮胎产业换新颜</h2>\n        <div class=\"story-grid\">\n          <div>\n            <p>走进山东广饶县轮胎企业生产车间，机器高速运转，数字化、智能化生产线有序运行。</p>\n            <p>截至2022年6月，当地轮胎产业纳入重点改造项目，推动设备更新、工艺升级和管理创新。</p>\n            <p>企业通过技术改造提高生产效率，降低能源消耗，产品质量和市场竞争力进一步提升。</p>\n            <p>[illegible]</p>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p>近年来，广饶县加快传统产业改造提升，围绕高端化、智能化、绿色化发展方向，引导企业加大研发投入。</p>\n            <p>“我们一度受制于设备和技术，如今生产线实现数字化控制。”企业有关负责人说。</p>\n            <p>产业链上下游协同创新，带动橡胶材料、装备制造等配套产业共同发展。</p>\n            <p>[illegible]</p>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p>传统优势产业如何焕发新活力？广饶县坚持以科技创新推动产业创新，促进轮胎产业转型升级。</p>\n            <p>通过实施技术改造、培育创新平台、强化人才支撑，产业发展质量持续提升。</p>\n            <p>目前，广饶县已形成较为完整的橡胶轮胎产业链，产品销往多个国家和地区。</p>\n            <p>[illegible]</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <div class=\"county-banner\">发展各具特色的县域经济</div>\n\n      <section class=\"bottom-right\">\n        <article>\n          <h3>1月社会融资规模增量创新高</h3>\n          <div class=\"text\">\n            <p>本报北京2月14日电（记者吴秋余）中国人民银行发布的最新数据显示，今年1月社会融资规模增量创历史同期新高。</p>\n            <p>初步统计，1月社会融资规模增量为7.06万亿元，比上年同期多5833亿元。</p>\n            <p>1月末，广义货币余额同比增长，人民币贷款余额保持增长，金融对实体经济支持力度持续加大。</p>\n            <p>[illegible]</p>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n        <aside class=\"side-copy\">\n          <p>增长11.4%，以上数据继续保持了两位数增长。</p>\n          <p>从结构看，政府债券、企业债券和人民币贷款等对社会融资规模增长形成支撑。</p>\n          <p>专家表示，金融总量合理增长，信贷结构持续优化，为经济回升向好提供有力支持。</p>\n          <p>[illegible]</p>\n        </aside>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
      },
      "finish_reason": "stop"
    }
